<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: The four of you, armed to the teeth, drop on an emerging insectoid nest. Eliminating this bug menace will be imperative to secure the local area.-->
  <VFEI2_MercenarySquad.description>你们四个全副武装，扑向一个正在出现的昆虫巢穴。消除这种虫子威胁对于确保当地安全至关重要。</VFEI2_MercenarySquad.description>
  <!--EN: New Squad-->
  <VFEI2_MercenarySquad.label>新阵容</VFEI2_MercenarySquad.label>
  <!--EN: Hired by an urbworld magnate with a thirst for thrilling holovid content, your mission was as perilous as it was lucrative. Armed to the teeth, your squad plunges from orbit in experimental hellpods, targeting a land swarming with deadly insectoids. The promise of a hefty payday made the risk worthwhile - until you discovered the magnate's treacherous plan to stiff you.\nAs the hellpods streak towards the surface, your trajectory locks onto a semi-developed insectoid hive colony. Expect fierce resistance, but if you triumph, the area teems with resources ripe for establishing a base - either a temporary haven or a long-term stronghold.\nYou’re aware that survival isn’t guaranteed for all, but with the element of surprise on your side, the odds tilt ever so slightly in your favor.\n\nNote: Since you start inside an insectoid megahive, this is a difficult scenario.-->
  <VFEI2_MercenarySquad.scenario.description>你受雇于一位都市世界巨头，渴望获得惊心动魄的全息内容，你的任务既危险又有利可图。全副武装，你的小队乘坐实验性的地狱舱从轨道上跳下，目标是一片充满致命类昆虫的土地。巨额发薪日的承诺让冒险变得值得 - 直到你发现大亨的奸诈计划来逼迫你。
当地狱豆冲向地表时，你的轨迹锁定在一个半发育的昆虫蜂巢群上。预计会有激烈的抵抗，但如果你获胜，该地区就会充满建立基地的成熟资源 - 无论是临时避难所还是长期据点。
你知道并不能保证所有人都能生存，但由于你身边有出其不意的因素，胜算稍微对你有利。

注意：由于你是在一个昆虫巨型蜂巢内开始的，所以这是一个困难的场景。</VFEI2_MercenarySquad.scenario.description>
  <!--EN: Hired by an urbworld magnate with a thirst for thrilling holovid content, your mission was as perilous as it was lucrative. Armed to the teeth, your squad plunges from orbit in experimental hellpods, targeting a land swarming with deadly insectoids. The promise of a hefty payday made the risk worthwhile - until you discovered the magnate's treacherous plan to stiff you.

As the hellpods streak towards the surface, your trajectory locks onto a semi-developed insectoid hive colony. Expect fierce resistance, but if you triumph, the area teems with resources ripe for establishing a base - either a temporary haven or a long-term stronghold.

You’re aware that survival isn’t guaranteed for all, but with the element of surprise on your side, the odds tilt ever so slightly in your favor.-->
  <VFEI2_MercenarySquad.scenario.parts.12.text>你受雇于一位都市世界巨头，渴望获得惊心动魄的全息内容，你的任务既危险又有利可图。全副武装，你的小队乘坐实验性的地狱舱从轨道上跳下，目标是一片充满致命类昆虫的土地。巨额发薪日的承诺让冒险变得值得 - 直到你发现大亨的奸诈计划来逼迫你。

当地狱豆冲向地表时，你的轨迹锁定在一个半发育的昆虫蜂巢群上。预计会遇到激烈的抵抗，但如果你取得胜利，该地区就会拥有丰富的资源，可以建立基地 - 无论是临时避难所还是长期据点。

你知道，并不能保证所有人都能生存，但由于你身边有惊喜元素，胜算会稍微对你有利。</VFEI2_MercenarySquad.scenario.parts.12.text>
  <!--EN: A group of mercenaries, diving into an insectoid menace. A classic VFE - Insectoids 2 experience.-->
  <VFEI2_MercenarySquad.scenario.summary>一群雇佣兵潜入昆虫威胁之中。经典的 VFE - Insectoids 2 体验。</VFEI2_MercenarySquad.scenario.summary>
</LanguageData>
